          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x^3-2x^2+4x-9)-x^2(x+3)&=-5x^2+4x-9\\\\(-5x^2+4x-9)-(-5x)(x+3)&=19x-9\\\\(19x-9)-19(x+3)&=-66\\\\\\frac{x^3-2x^2+4x-9}{x+3}&=x^2-5x+19-\\frac{66}{x+3}.\\end{align*}$$",
